# Title: Hiding Files with Attrib.exe
# ID: 4281cb20-2994-4580-aa63-c8b86d019934
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Sami Ruohonen
# Date: 2019-01-16
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1564.001
# Description: Detects usage of attrib.exe to hide files from users.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_exec="* +h *") AND ((process_path="*\\attrib.exe") OR (process_name="ATTRIB.EXE"))) AND NOT ((process_exec="*\\desktop.ini *")) AND NOT ((parent_process_path="*\\cmd.exe" AND process_exec="+R +H +S +A \\\\\\*.cui" AND parent_process_exec="C:\\\\WINDOWS\\\\system32\\\\\\*.bat")))
